      },
      "message": "chore: bootstrap Pinacoteca project\n\nClean-room reimplementation of Picasa's viewing, album organization and\nphoto maintenance workflow, written in Rust.\n\n- Cargo workspace: app, core, decoders, db crates\n- Domain skeleton with tests: catalog, albums, non-destructive edit stack\n- SQLite schema v1 (catalog, albums, tags, edit stacks)\n- Documentation: vision, scope, roadmap, architecture, clean-room protocol\n- CI: fmt, clippy, test on Linux and Windows\n- GPL-3.0-or-later\n\nProprietary reference binaries are git-ignored and never redistributed.",
